Z||000000||turbo86se||09-15-2000||01:30 AM||||<BR>I finally made it to MD, from SC tonight. My sister is getting married Saturday, it will be a blast!!<BR>Anyways, while on my way up on I95 in NC, first I passed a nice, clean 87 or 88 coupe. It had the coupe nose, but a GT rear bumper. It was silver. Then, I was just thinking about how I probably won't see another Fiero, I passed a bright red 88GT. No spoiler, shiny custom wheels, it was sweet!!  Both cars were going south on I95. If you're on here, thought I'd say hi!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||5
